# Updated Orientation Day Schedule

**Document Author:** Maria Garcia  
**Date:** March 26, 2026  
**Context:** This document contains the finalized updates to the orientation day schedule as per the last-minute changes provided by the registrar. All staff and volunteers are requested to review these updates carefully.

