## 1. Overview of Updates

The following changes have been made to the orientation day schedule based on the registrar's latest instructions:
- Adjustment to the start time of the opening ceremony.
- Reallocation of rooms for breakout sessions.
- Inclusion of an additional Q&A session for STEM majors.
- Reassigned time slots for the campus tours.

These updates aim to enhance the experience for both students and staff, ensuring a smooth and organized event.

---

