| 2:00 PM     | Campus Tours (Group A)                       | Meet at Main Lobby    |
| 2:30 PM     | Campus Tours (Group B)                       | Meet at Main Lobby    |
| 3:00 PM     | Q&A Session: STEM Majors                     | Auditorium            |
| 3:30 PM     | Break                                        | N/A                   |
| 3:45 PM     | Leadership Panel: Insights from Alumni       | Room 105              |

